# Tier 2 — private reference material (internal harness docs, company skills).
# Never commit: contains real ticket IDs, internal acronyms, and customer scenarios.
# Kept OUTSIDE productivity/ on purpose: those directories get copied to
# ~/.claude/skills/, and private files must not ride along with an install.
_private/

